N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CITIZEN WATCH CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI KOZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CITIZEN WATCH CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI, KOZO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI KOZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI, KOZO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Conventionally when the dial of an electronic watch is composed of a solar cell comprising a substrate and an amorphous silicon film on the substrate, the design of the dial is greatly restricted by the structure. According to the invention, the substrate constituting a solar cell has a light transmittance, and hence the solar cell cannot be seen. By using such a substrate as the dial or the windshield glass, a watch with a solar cell free from restriction on the design of the dial can be produced.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>De manière générale, lorsque le cadran d'une montre électronique comprend une cellule solaire qui comprend à son tour un substrat sur lequel est déposé un film de silicium amorphe, la structure limite fortement les différentes conceptions du cadran. D'après cette invention, le substrat constituant la cellule solaire possède une transmittance à la lumière, ce qui permet de cacher la cellule solaire. En utilisant un tel substrat en tant que cadran ou verre de montre, on peut obtenir une montre avec une cellule solaire sans imposer de limites quant à la conception du cadran.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>